{"path":"io/manip/emit_on_flush","title":"std::emit_on_flush, std::noemit_on_flush","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>emit_on_flush, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>noemit_on_flush","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/manip/emit_on_flush","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"If os.rdbuf() actually points to a std::basic_syncbuf<CharT, Traits, Allocator> buf, toggles whether it emits (i.e., transmits data to the underlying stream buffer) when flushed:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ostream\">&lt;ostream&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> emit_on_flush<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> os <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> CharT, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Traits <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> noemit_on_flush<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\"><span class=\"kw1732\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_ostream</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> os <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">os.<span class=\"me1\">rdbuf</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> actually points to a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_syncbuf\"><span class=\"kw2664\">std::<span class=\"me2\">basic_syncbuf</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>CharT, Traits, Allocator<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> <code>buf</code>, toggles whether it emits (i.e., transmits data to the underlying stream buffer) when flushed:\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">buf.<span class=\"me1\">set_emit_on_sync</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> calls <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">buf.<span class=\"me1\">set_emit_on_sync</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code></div>\n<p>Otherwise, these manipulators have no effect.\n</p><p>This is an output-only I/O manipulator, it may be called with an expression such as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">out <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">emit_on_flush</span></span></code> for any <code>out</code> of type <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ostream\">std::basic_ostream</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  os\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  reference to output stream\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code>os</code> (reference to the stream after manipulation)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_syncbuf/set_emit_on_sync\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>set_emit_on_sync</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  changes the current emit-on-sync policy <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_syncbuf&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/manip","title":"Input/output manipulators"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::emit_on_flush, std::noemit_on_flush","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. If os.rdbuf() actually points to a std::basic_syncbuf<CharT, Traits, Allocator> buf, toggles whether it emits (i.e…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"os"},{"label":"Return value","note":"os (reference to the stream after manipulation)"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"set_emit_on_sync","note":"changes the current emit-on-sync policy"}]}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":130,"codeBlockCount":0}
